# Commit attribution

When you create a git commit, the message body MUST end with a GitHub-valid trailer from `node scripts/co-author.mjs <Harness> <Model>`.

This session: `Co-authored-by: Cursor + Grok 4.6 <cursor+grok-4.6@noreply.humanmax.ai>`

- Blank line before the trailer
- Name is `Harness + Model`, not a person's GitHub login
- Email is `<harness>+<model-slug>@noreply.humanmax.ai`
- Do not skip the trailer on agent-authored commits
- See `docs/agents/commit-attribution.md`
